@BaseUrl = http://localhost:5200/api/horses

### Owner and visible riders of a horse, the owner is always the first entry
GET {{BaseUrl}}/1/riders

### Hidden riders of a horse
GET {{BaseUrl}}/1/riders/hidden

### Add a person as rider (Reitbeteiligung), 409 if they already belong to the horse
POST {{BaseUrl}}/1/riders/10

### Hide a rider, 409 for the owner
PUT {{BaseUrl}}/1/riders/10/hidden

### Show a hidden rider again
DELETE {{BaseUrl}}/1/riders/10/hidden
